---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="Vittoria Romano, web development student: how I work, what I build and how to reach me."
>
	<div class="flow">
		<h1>About</h1>
		<p>
			I'm Vittoria, a web development student. This site is where I collect the things I build in
			class and on my own, and the things I care about away from the screen.
		</p>
		<p>
			I build mobile first, starting at 320px and adding breakpoints only where the content needs
			them. I write my own CSS with custom properties and fluid type, without frameworks, because I
			want to understand every line that ships.
		</p>
		<p>
			I work in small branches with reviewed pull requests, and I use AI tools as a collaborator: I
			plan with them, then decide what to keep and what to reject.
		</p>
		<p>
			Want to talk about a project, an internship or something I made? My links are at the bottom of
			every page.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
